WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Hi, I'm Cindy Quinn, owner of CMQ Headshots.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
I'm a professional headshot photographer in Phoenix, Arizona.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.500
I take pride in my ability to make people feel comfortable in front of my camera.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.000
It's a big part of my process, and it's the first step

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.500
towards creating a headshot that you'll truly love.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Most of my clients walk out saying it was the most relaxed

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
photo session they have ever had.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.500
I look forward to working with you.
